        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, we are fully IBA approved, meaning we adhere to the Indian Banks Association’s mover code of conduct. This accreditation guarantees transparent pricing, verified insurance, and a grievance redress mechanism backed by banks. For customers, it translates to trustworthy service, protection against hidden fees, and a reliable channel for claim settlement if issues arise.</p>
