        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What does the 100% insurance coverage protect during a move from Bakkrwala?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our 100% insurance, sanctioned by IRDAI, covers the full declared value of every item in transit, from household goods to delicate antiques. In the unlikely event of loss, damage, or theft, you can file a claim and receive reimbursement up to the insured amount. The policy also includes accidental damage during loading, unloading, and road transport, giving you complete peace of mind.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How are antique furniture and fragile items safeguarded by the 7‑layer packaging system?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The 7‑layer system starts with 80‑GSM heavy‑duty bubble wrap for shock absorption, followed by high‑density foam edge protectors, multi‑ply corrugated sheets, and a moisture‑resistant stretch film. For especially delicate pieces, we add custom‑cut wooden crates and reinforced corner brackets. Each layer is meticulously sealed, ensuring protection against vibration, humidity, and impact throughout the 850 km journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What are the typical charges for transporting a king‑size bed from Bakkrwala?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Bed transportation is billed based on size, weight, and the required handling equipment. For a standard king‑size bed, the base freight charge ranges from INR 3,200 to INR 4,500, plus a modest loading‑unloading fee of INR 500. If you opt for additional protective crating or insurance beyond the declared value, those costs are itemised separately in the final invoice.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does service tax affect the final bill for packers and movers in India?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Service tax, currently set at 18%, is applied to the subtotal of all moving services—including freight, packing materials, and insurance premiums. The tax amount is clearly itemised on the invoice, ensuring transparency. For corporate or government relocations, the tax component can be claimed as input tax credit, subject to prevailing GST regulations.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my shipment in real time during the 850 km transit from Bakkrwala?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. Every truck in our fleet is equipped with satellite‑enabled GPS devices that feed live location data to our control centre. Customers receive a secure tracking link via SMS or email, allowing you to monitor the exact position, estimated arrival time, and any checkpoint stops throughout the journey.</p>
